{"page":18,"h":11508,"lines":[{"conf":1,"x":0.099762497818189064,"w":0.82185269640637681,"h":0.021825396825396859,"text":"proposes to draw near to God must first pass through the dark","y":0.93749999956845054},{"y":0.91567460311526283,"text":"valley of self-surrender. Only out of the valley of the shadow","x":0.099762494750097269,"w":0.82185269640637681,"conf":1,"h":0.020371908233279279},{"h":0.021917681845407655,"text":"of death, where the self-will of man dies, shines the light of","conf":1,"x":0.099762483315519151,"y":0.89087301572195077,"w":0.82422801426478787},{"x":0.10213778481711654,"text":"that plenitude of life which God bestows.","conf":1,"y":0.86918604686366718,"w":0.55344415639902089,"h":0.020446889930301193},{"text":"And on what basis shall we dare to penetrate the darkness","y":0.84593023270669043,"conf":1,"w":0.78622327532087055,"x":0.13301663039182132,"h":0.02038921155626805},{"w":0.82226498096020184,"text":"of this self-surrender? With what justification shall we allow","y":0.82177279158902683,"h":0.027170378064352407,"x":0.099562008888850334,"conf":1},{"x":0.099762496119851843,"w":0.82185269640637681,"y":0.79935515916193967,"h":0.021865770930335704,"text":"ourselves to sink deep into this darkness trusting that God's","conf":1},{"h":0.020435354066273503,"text":"hand will enfold and keep us with gracious strength? For","y":0.7775297619479663,"x":0.099762496119851843,"w":0.82185269640637681,"conf":1},{"w":0.81710211023107759,"text":"this reason alone, but really for this reason, namely, that the","x":0.10213778609586248,"h":0.020441121525234696,"y":0.75436046554099268,"conf":1},{"text":"unknown God has made Himself known to us in His word.","x":0.099762498115101059,"y":0.73401162813283638,"w":0.82185269640637681,"h":0.018964562151167152,"conf":1},{"x":0.099762476186847082,"w":0.81947742808948876,"conf":1,"y":0.70783730131477252,"h":0.02182539682539697,"text":"For the reason that we have His word, which bids us believe;"},{"y":0.68750000022585966,"conf":1,"x":0.099762469417251004,"h":0.01889534791310632,"text":"His word which Jesus Christ the Crucified and Risen Lord","w":0.81947742808948876},{"conf":1,"y":0.66269841293277199,"x":0.099762480432690218,"w":0.81947742808948876,"h":0.021894610117352165,"text":"proclaims to us; His word which promises us the resurrection"},{"h":0.024083197116851807,"conf":1,"text":"of the dead, His word which yields the riches of its truth","x":0.097291892728768536,"y":0.63903712753430064,"w":0.82207751583743405},{"text":"only to him who believes, but really to him who believes.","conf":1,"y":0.61627906979144553,"h":0.021865771876441231,"w":0.78859854363775861,"x":0.099762485045728738},{"h":0.020389211556268161,"y":0.59593023287384161,"x":0.13064133966591782,"w":0.79334912981305805,"text":"The last verse of our text runs: \"Now when they heard of","conf":1},{"text":"the resurrection of the dead, some mocked; but others said,","conf":1,"x":0.099762477628165758,"w":0.82185269640637681,"y":0.57118055544170954,"h":0.02184270014838563},{"h":0.021865770930335704,"conf":1,"y":0.54935515913286981,"text":"'We will hear you again about this.? \" To which of these two","x":0.099762479457121869,"w":0.81947742808948854},{"y":0.52604166698803512,"w":0.41330164129083807,"h":0.020585317460317443,"x":0.099762486183559484,"conf":1,"text":"groups do we wish to belong?"},{"text":"For him who dares to make his self-surrender on the basis","conf":1,"x":0.13301663328671418,"y":0.50719246079001268,"w":0.78622327532087055,"h":0.017609126984126977},{"text":"of the promise, the word: \"In Him we live and move and","w":0.81995743590515935,"y":0.47960674504364931,"conf":1,"x":0.099505840862919165,"h":0.026535272598266713},{"y":0.45783730136927836,"h":0.021825396825396748,"w":0.81947742808948865,"x":0.099762477712975403,"text":"have our being\" is filled with a new meaning. The hymn in","conf":1},{"y":0.43542993543269481,"x":0.099148681301337152,"w":0.21507087311187351,"h":0.021269071669805628,"conf":1,"text":"which we sang:"},{"w":0.29691210660067474,"x":0.19239905115334438,"y":0.39384920600061113,"text":"\"Thou alone shalt be","conf":1,"h":0.018941491369217189},{"w":0.27553444404106631,"h":0.021865770930335704,"conf":1,"text":"Our God and Lord,","y":0.36627906999493387,"x":0.21377672372768533},{"h":0.022316187147110145,"text":"To Thee all praise and honour we accord!\"","conf":1,"y":0.34400421722785179,"x":0.21132390867599787,"w":0.60590689522879471},{"conf":1,"text":"continues thus:","y":0.31249999960515662,"w":0.20902611373306867,"x":0.099762475485009647,"h":0.015988372621082103},{"conf":1,"y":0.27027656883933626,"h":0.026367634061783107,"text":"\"O Breath that fills the whole, that works in all,","x":0.1754813861849383,"w":0.67279102275897951},{"conf":1,"x":0.25854373870863934,"y":0.25128743790161345,"w":0.39043515688413144,"h":0.022873198229169001,"text":"In whom we live and move,"},{"conf":1,"w":0.63657953832056624,"h":0.020371908233279279,"y":0.22817460313948768,"x":0.19714966607328768,"text":"Thou shoreless Sea, in thy strange depth I fall"},{"conf":1,"y":0.20486111069430291,"w":0.38717339255593042,"h":0.020429586607312422,"x":0.26128265962634423,"text":"Thy boundless life to prove:"},{"y":0.17943189071345689,"x":0.1968206096553187,"conf":1,"text":"Myself in Thee, Thyself in me to bind","h":0.026277803239368236,"w":0.5255161632191051},{"text":"Until Thyself alone I see, I find.\"","h":0.023365402032458626,"y":0.15843023292271241,"x":0.19714965135960053,"w":0.46555818830217632,"conf":1},{"y":0.065406976772855674,"conf":1,"w":0.030878859680968485,"text":"22","h":0.013081395436847054,"x":0.49168646111642111}],"w":7029}